0010-gpui-desktop-host-functions.patch (combined series, 2026-11-13). Formerly 0010-gpui-desktop-host-functions.patch (original kept in nsh-host-patches/superseded-2026-11-13/).
Applies with patch -p1 at the root of a copy of nsh-host-allspeech-src after every earlier patch of the series 0010-0020, in order.

0010: desktop host functions (on top of 0001, 0002, 0003, 0005, 0006, 0007, 0008, 0009; macOS).

`host.call`: `desktop.capabilities` (the names below), `dock.setBadge` (string | null), `window.frame` (outer frame,
top-left screen coordinates, maximized, fullScreen, every screen's visible frame), `window.setMinSize` ({width,height}), `window.setOrigin` ({x,y}),
`notifications.post` ({id,title,body?,sound?}, UserNotifications loaded with dlopen, delegate class made at run time).
`host.on` events: `app.openUrls` (string[]: URL schemes and file:// URLs from application:openURLs:), `app.reopen`,
`window.frameChanged`, `notifications.clicked` ({id}). New file src/desktop_host.rs; one-line hooks in app.rs, lib.rs.
No new crates, no Cargo.lock change (uses block2, dispatch2, libc, objc2, objc2-foundation already added by 0005/0009).

